sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ServiceA as Service A (Client)
    participant ServiceB as Service B (Server)

    ServiceA->>ServiceB: ClientHello (Supported Cipher Suites & TLS Key Share)
    ServiceB->>ServiceA: ServerHello + Server Certificate + CertificateRequest
    Note over ServiceA: 1. Service A verifies Service B's Certificate against internal Trust Store (CA)
    ServiceA->>ServiceB: Client Certificate + CertificateVerify (Signature) + Finished
    Note over ServiceB: 2. Service B verifies Service A's Certificate against internal Trust Store (CA)
    ServiceB->>ServiceA: Finished
    Note over ServiceA,ServiceB: Mutual Authentication Established (Both Identities Verified)
    ServiceA->>ServiceB: Encrypted RPC / HTTP Request
    ServiceB-->>ServiceA: Encrypted Response
